HTRAG_EXTRACT_MODEL`) | Document ingestion only — builds the knowledge graph |\n| **Embeddings** | `text-embedding-3-small` | Document ingestion (index) + every search query |\n| **LightRAG retrieval** | _no LLM_ | `only_need_context=True` — returns raw chunks, no generation |","replace_all":false},"tool_use_id":"toolu_016GdfQzXHJtVVUFcb7F31q2"}

