2026-05-25T15:24:36.248Z {"session_id":"8e6f4227-1c72-4eb5-85c7-a4a0703b9a66","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\yasmi\\.claude\\projects\\e--workstuff-platform-ai-assistant-worktrees-agents-architectural-review-project-files\\8e6f4227-1c72-4eb5-85c7-a4a0703b9a66.jsonl","cwd":"E:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant.worktrees\\agents-architectural-review-project-files","permission_mode":"default","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cat -n \"e:/workstuff/platform_ai_assistant.worktrees/agents-architectural-review-project-files/README.md\""},"tool_response":{"stdout":"     1\t# AI Assistant\n     2\t\n     3\tFastAPI RAG chatbot for the **iSEL** platform. Answers user questions in **Russian** and **Kazakh** using a LightRAG knowledge graph (graph + vector hybrid) backed by OpenAI.\n     4\t\n     5\t- **UI:** `http://localhost:8001/static/index.html`\n     6\t- **Health:** `GET /health` → `{\"status\": \"ok\", \"service\": \"isel-bot\"}`\n     7\t\n     8\t---\n     9\t\n    10\t## Quick Start\n    11\t\n    12\t```bash\n    13\t# 1. Virtual environment\n    14\tpython -m venv venv\n    15\tvenv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1        # PowerShell\n    16\t# source venv/Scripts/activate   # bash / Git Bash\n    17\t\n    18\t# 2. Dependencies\n    19\tpip install -r requirements.txt\n    20\t\n    21\t# 3. Create .env\n    22\tOPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...\n    23\tLLM_PROVIDER=openai\n    24\tOPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5-mini            # chat responses — reasoning model OK\n    25\tLIGHTRAG_EXTRACT_MODEL=gpt-4.1-nano  # entity extraction — NON-reasoning only\n    26\t\n    27\t# 4. Ingest documents into the knowledge graph\n    28\tpython ingestion/ingest.py\n    29\t\n    30\t# 5. Run\n    31\tuvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8001\n    32\t```\n    33\t\n    34\t> **`LIGHTRAG_EXTRACT_MODEL` must be a non-reasoning model.** Reasoning models (`o`-series, `gpt-5-mini`) exhaust `max_completion_tokens` on LightRAG's 14 KB extraction prompt and produce 0 entities. `OPENAI_MODEL` (used for chat) can be any model including reasoning ones — `max_completion_tokens=8000` provides enough budget for internal reasoning tokens.\n    35\t\n    36\t---\n    37\t\n    38\t## Tech Stack\n    39\t\n    40\t| Layer | Technology |\n    41\t|---|---|\n    42\t| API | FastAPI + Uvicorn |\n    43\t| RAG / KG | LightRAG-HKU (NetworkX graph + nano-vectordb) |\n    44\t| LLM (chat) | OpenAI `gpt-5-mini` (configurable via `OPENAI_MODEL`) |\n    45\t| LLM (extraction) | OpenAI `gpt-4.1-nano` (configurable via `LIGHTRAG_EXTRACT_MODEL`) |\n    46\t| Embeddings | OpenAI `text-embedding-3-small` |\n    47\t| Session state | In-memory `SessionManager` — lost on restart |\n    48\t| Streaming | Server-Sent Events (reindex progress) |\n    49\t| Config | YAML: `config/services.yaml`, `config/keywords.yaml` |\n    50\t\n    51\t---\n    52\t\n    53\t## Project Structure\n    54\t\n    55\t```\n    56\tapp/\n    57\t├── config/\n    58\t│   └── service_registry.py   # Singleton — loads YAML once at import\n    59\t├── flows/\n    60\t│   ├── base.py               # FlowContext dataclass + BaseFlow interface\n    61\t│   ├── linear.py             # Step-by-step flows (entity-gated where needed)\n    62\t│   ├── scenario.py           # Branching flows (real estate)\n    63\t│   ├── faq.py                # Pure retrieval, no state\n    64\t│   └── registry.py           # get_flow(), classify_intent(), INTENT_KEYWORDS\n    65\t│                             #   — built dynamically from config/keywords.yaml\n    66\t├── models/\n    67\t│   └── schemas.py            # ChatRequest, ChatResponse, FlowState\n    68\t├── routers/\n    69\t│   ├── chat.py               # POST /api/v1/chat\n    70\t│   └── documents.py          # upload / list / delete / reindex\n    71\t├── services/\n    72\t│   ├── lightrag_service.py   # LightRAG init + search_docs()\n    73\t│   ├── llm_service.py        # OpenAI/Ollama call\n    74\t│   ├── prompt_builder.py     # Static base prompt + dynamic suffix (prefix caching)\n    75\t│   ├── rulebased.py          # SYSTEM_COMMANDS + NAVIGATION_RULES (zero LLM cost)\n    76\t│   ├── session.py            # SessionManager\n    77\t│   ├── rate_limit.py         # Per-session rate limiter\n    78\t│   ├── task_queue.py         # Async ingestion queue (max 2 concurrent)\n    79\t│   └── validation.py         # Input validation\n    80\t└── main.py                   # App entry point, StaticFiles mount\n    81\t\n    82\tconfig/\n    83\t├── services.yaml             # Service definitions, flow type, nav paths\n    84\t└── keywords.yaml             # Intent keywords (flow_keywords + filter_keywords)\n    85\t\n    86\tingestion/\n    87\t└── ingest.py                 # Document parser + LightRAG inserter\n    88\t\n    89\tdata/\n    90\t├── docs/                     # Raw document staging (gitignored)\n    91\t└── lightrag/                 # Persistent KG — back this up before any wipe (gitignored)\n    92\t\n    93\tfrontend/                     # Static UI (glassmorphism widget)\n    94\ttests/                        # pytest suite, 200+ tests, ~95% pass rate\n    95\t```\n    96\t\n    97\t---\n    98\t\n    99\t## Request Pipeline\n   100\t\n   101\t```\n   102\tPOST /api/v1/chat\n   103\t  │\n   104\t  ├─ validate (ChatRequest)\n   105\t  ├─ rate_limit (per session_id)\n   106\t  ├─ rule_based check          ──→ returns immediately if matched\n   107\t  │    SYSTEM_COMMANDS: greetings, identity, handoff\n   108\t  │    NAVIGATION_RULES: status/download queries (zero LLM tokens)\n   109\t  │\n   110\t  ├─ language detect (Kazakh Cyrillic heuristic: ә ғ қ ң ө ұ ү і)\n   111\t  ├─ intent classify (sticky → keyword switch → page fallback)\n   112\t  ├─ navigation FAQ shortcut   ──→ nav path answer, no LLM\n   113\t  ├─ FAQ interruption gate     ──→ FAQFlow answer, flow state preserved\n   114\t  ├─ entity detect (ФЛ / ЮЛ from message + history)\n   115\t  ├─ entity clarification gate (blocks LinearFlow until entity known)\n   116\t  ├─ flow.next_state()         ──→ LinearFlow / ScenarioFlow / FAQFlow\n   117\t  ├─ search_docs()             ──→ LightRAG hybrid + intent/step filter\n   118\t  ├─ ask_llm()                 ──→ OpenAI with cached static prompt + dynamic suffix\n   119\t  └─ session.update()          ──→ state + history (capped at 10 entries / 5 turns)\n   120\t\n   121\tResponse: ChatResponse(answer, source, handoff)\n   122\tsource values: \"rule_based\" | \"faq_interruption\" | \"llm\"\n   123\t```\n   124\t\n   125\t---\n   126\t\n   127\t## API Reference\n   128\t\n   129\t### `POST /api/v1/chat`\n   130\t\n   131\t```json\n   132\t// Request\n   133\t{\n   134\t  \"message\": \"Как подать заявку на ТУ?\",\n   135\t  \"session_id\": \"user-abc\",\n   136\t  \"page\": \"шаг 1\",         // optional — used for intent detection on fresh sessions\n   137\t  \"language\": \"ru\"          // optional — overrides auto-detect\n   138\t}\n   139\t\n   140\t// Response\n   141\t{\n   142\t  \"answer\": \"Чтобы дать точную инструкцию...\",\n   143\t  \"source\": \"llm\",\n   144\t  \"handoff\": false\n   145\t}\n   146\t```\n   147\t\n   148\t### `GET /health`\n   149\t\n   150\t```json\n   151\t{\"status\": \"ok\", \"service\": \"isel-bot\"}\n   152\t```\n   153\t\n   154\t### `POST /api/v1/upload`\n   155\t\n   156\tMultipart file upload. Saves to `data/docs/`, queues async ingestion (max 2 concurrent).  \n   157\tSupported formats: `.pdf` `.txt` `.md` `.docx`\n   158\t\n   159\t### `GET /api/v1/documents`\n   160\t\n   161\tLists all files in `data/docs/`.\n   162\t\n   163\t### `DELETE /api/v1/documents/{filename}`\n   164\t\n   165\tRemoves the file from disk. **Does not** remove KG nodes — those persist until full reindex.\n   166\t\n   167\t### `POST /api/v1/reindex`\n   168\t\n   169\tFull wipe of `data/lightrag/` + rebuild from all files in `data/docs/`. Progress streamed via SSE:\n   170\t\n   171\t```\n   172\tdata: {\"status\": \"progress\", \"file\": \"foo.pdf\", \"done\": 1, \"total\": 5}\n   173\tdata: {\"status\": \"ping\"}      ← heartbeat every ~15s\n   174\tdata: {\"status\": \"done\"}      ← always sent, even on partial failure\n   175\t```\n   176\t\n   177\t---\n   178\t\n   179\t## Supported Services (14 intents)\n   180\t\n   181\tAll definitions live in `config/services.yaml` + `config/keywords.yaml`. **Adding a new service requires no code changes** — only YAML edits.\n   182\t\n   183\t| Intent key | Display name (RU) | Flow | Steps | Entity gate |\n   184\t|---|---|---|---|---|\n   185\t| `tu_application` | Заявление на технические условия | Linear | 5 | Yes |\n   186\t| `primary_connection_residential` | Первичное подключение (бытовой) | Linear | 4 | No |\n   187\t| `primary_connection_nonresidential` | Первичное подключение (небытовой) | Linear | 5 | No |\n   188\t| `secondary_connection` | Вторичное подключение | Linear | 3 | Yes |\n   189\t| `contract_termination` | Расторжение договора | Linear | 3 | Yes |\n   190\t| `grid_disconnection` | Отключение от электросетей | Linear | 2 | Yes |\n   191\t| `equipment_testing` | Испытание, измерение электрооборудования | Linear | 4 | Yes |\n   192\t| `real_estate` | Добавление объекта недвижимости | Scenario | — | No |\n   193\t| `supply_contract_residential` | Договор электроснабжения (бытовой) | FAQ | — | No |\n   194\t| `supply_contract_non_residential` | Договор электроснабжения (небытовой) | FAQ | — | No |\n   195\t| `load_calculation` | Расчёт электрической нагрузки | FAQ | — | No |\n   196\t| `draft_design` | Разработка эскизного проекта | FAQ | — | No |\n   197\t| `construction_works` | Строительно-монтажные работы | FAQ | — | No |\n   198\t| `meter_sealing` | Установка/снятие пломбы | FAQ | — | No |\n   199\t\n   200\t**Entity gate** — LinearFlow blocks at step 0 until user identifies as ФЛ (individual) or ЮЛ (legal entity). Step 1 form fields differ by entity type.\n   201\t\n   202\t---\n   203\t\n   204\t## Adding a New Service\n   205\t\n   206\tNo code changes required:\n   207\t\n   208\t1. Add a block to `config/services.yaml` — set `flow.type` to `linear`, `scenario`, or `faq`.\n   209\t2. Add matching `flow_keywords` and `filter_keywords` to `config/keywords.yaml`.\n   210\t3. Upload documents structured with `Ситуация N` / `Шаг N` headers via `POST /api/v1/upload` or `python ingestion/ingest.py`.\n   211\t\n   212\t`ServiceRegistry` is a singleton; `registry.py` builds `_FLOWS` and `INTENT_KEYWORDS` dynamically from config on startup.\n   213\t\n   214\t> To add a **new flow type** (new Python class): inherit `BaseFlow`, override `next_state()` + `build_query()`, register in `registry.py`. See `CLAUDE.md`.\n   215\t\n   216\t---\n   217\t\n   218\t## Prompt Architecture (OpenAI Prefix Caching)\n   219\t\n   220\t```\n   221\t┌─ STATIC BASE — identical per language → cache hit on every request ──────┐\n   222\t│  <role>  <language_rule>  <intent_handling>                              │\n   223\t│  <navigation_facts>       <rules>  <formatting>                          │\n   224\t└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n   225\t┌─ DYNAMIC SUFFIX — built per request ─────────────────────────────────────┐\n   226\t│  <history>        last 3 turns                                           │\n   227\t│  <intent_context> intent / entity / page / situation                    │\n   228\t│  <step_control>   current step number + \"Далее\" button instruction      │\n   229\t└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n   230\t```\n   231\t\n   232\tNavigation facts are **auto-generated** from `ServiceRegistry`. Add new paths to `services.yaml → navigation_path`, not to `prompt_builder.py`.\n   233\t\n   234\t---\n   235\t\n   236\t## Document Chunking\n   237\t\n   238\t`split_by_situations()` in `ingestion/ingest.py`:\n   239\t\n   240\t1. **Situation blocks** — `Ситуация \\d+` / `Жағдай \\d+` / `Шаг \\d+` → one LightRAG insert each.\n   241\t2. **Meta blocks** — `Цель интента` / `Мақсаты` / `Требования` → lower priority.\n   242\t3. **Deduplication** — keeps highest-quality version of duplicate situations.\n   243\t4. **Fallback** — 800-word fixed chunks (overlap=100) if no structured headers found.\n   244\t\n   245\tEach chunk gets a metadata header:\n   246\t```\n   247\t[FILENAME: file.pdf] [INTENT: tu_application] [LANGUAGE: ru] [TITLE: Ситуация 1]\n   248\t```\n   249\t\n   250\t> Ingestion cost: ~0.5–2 USD per 100 KB document (entity extraction via OpenAI).\n   251\t\n   252\t---\n   253\t\n   254\t## LightRAG Search Pipeline\n   255\t\n   256\t`search_docs()` in `app/services/lightrag_service.py`:\n   257\t\n   258\t1. **Query enrichment** — prepend `[TITLE: Шаг N]`, `[INTENT: slug]`, `[entity]`.\n   259\t2. **Hybrid search** — graph traversal + vector similarity (`top_k=20`, `only_need_context=True`).\n   260\t3. **Intent filter** — keep only chunks whose `[INTENT:]` tag matches current intent.\n   261\t4. **Step filter** — if `current_step` is set, keep only chunks containing `Шаг N`; return `\"\"` if none (triggers fallback).\n   262\t5. **Step fallback** — retry with `\"Шаг N {query}\"`, `top_k*2`, no metadata prefix.\n   263\t\n   264\tTwo separate OpenAI clients: `_oai_embeddings` (timeout 300s) and `_oai_llm` (timeout 600s). Kept separate because a shared short-timeout client would abort slow entity extractions mid-run.\n   265\t\n   266\t---\n   267\t\n   268\t## Running Tests\n   269\t\n   270\t```bash\n   271\tpython -m pytest tests/ -v\n   272\t\n   273\t# Single module\n   274\tpython -m pytest tests/test_service_registry.py -v\n   275\t```\n   276\t\n   277\t---\n   278\t\n   279\t## Environment Variables\n   280\t\n   281\t| Variable | Required | Default | Notes |\n   282\t|---|---|---|---|\n   283\t| `OPENAI_API_KEY` | Yes | — | |\n   284\t| `LLM_PROVIDER` | No | `openai` | `openai` or `ollama` |\n   285\t| `OPENAI_MODEL` | No | `gpt-4.1-nano` | Chat responses — reasoning models supported |\n   286\t| `LIGHTRAG_EXTRACT_MODEL` | No | `gpt-4.1-nano` | Entity extraction — **non-reasoning models only** |\n   287\t| `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` | No | `http://localhost:11434` | Ollama fallback |\n   288\t| `OLLAMA_MODEL` | No | `llama3.2` | Ollama fallback |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vmu1wXgxyFNduU6tMN1dz6","duration_ms":663}

